- `python -m pytest tests/unit/test_risk_report_contract.py tests/unit/test_risk_report_html.py tests/unit/test_tasar_playground_adapter.py` -> 31 passed.
- `python -m ruff check ui/components/risk_report_contract.py ui/components/risk_report_html.py tests/unit/test_risk_report_contract.py tests/unit/test_risk_report_html.py` -> passed.

